and \u201C2\u201D provide access to the Cosmos Hall.</p>\n</blockquote></div></div></div></div><div class=\"modal-footer\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/details/fse-2025/fse-2025-research-papers/32/Bridging-Operator-Semantic-Inconsistencies-A-Source-level-Cross-framework-Model-Conv\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default navigate\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-new-window\"></span> All Details</a></span><a href=\"#\" data-dismiss=\"modal\" class=\"btn btn-default\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-remove\"></span> Close</a></div></div></div></div>"},{ "action": "runscript", "value": "$('#modal-b5dc3a9b-d5a9-4129-9a25-dd0b892a4a01').modal({ backdrop: 'static', keyboard: true}, 'show');" },
